# Nexus Industries Digital Transformation Strategy

**Document Type:** Strategic Initiative
**Authority Level:** 2 (Primary)
**Last Updated:** January 2026
**Classification:** Internal

---

## Executive Summary

The Digital Transformation Strategy outlines Nexus Industries' five-year journey to become a digitally-enabled enterprise, leveraging AI, automation, and data analytics to drive efficiency, innovation, and competitive advantage.

---

## Digital Vision

**Vision:** Transform Nexus Industries into an AI-first, data-driven enterprise that delivers exceptional value through digital innovation.

**Goals:**
1. $300M annual efficiency gains by 2030
2. 80% processes digitized
3. AI embedded in all major decisions
4. Real-time operations visibility

