### Pillar 1: Intelligent Operations

**Objective:** Deploy AI-driven operations across manufacturing and supply chain

| Initiative | Investment | Benefit |
|------------|------------|---------|
| Smart Factory | $85M | 15% productivity gain |
| Predictive Maintenance | $35M | 25% downtime reduction |
| Supply Chain AI | $45M | 10% cost reduction |
| Quality Analytics | $25M | 50% defect reduction |

**Key Milestones:**
- 2026: Pilot at 2 facilities
